{"server":"tw","storyId":"act3d0_level_act3d0_08_end","groupId":"act3d0","stageId":"a003_08","title":"汐斯塔狂想曲","storyCode":"OF-8","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"4d5f58ffbe2efc6d44bb7701e086e7d48f40f25cd3d81136804752adb7e5a885","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"打敗巨型源石蟲後，雖然只是噴發被暫緩，但事情終於暫時告一段落。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"喝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"哼！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"它真的有在變虛弱嗎？這模樣完全看不出來啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"小心岩漿！這傢伙肚子裡到底吞下了多少黑曜石！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨大源石蟲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"————————————————！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然有些可憐，但我們也不能手下留情！天火！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，我明白！現在可不是保留實力的時候了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，這招如何！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨大源石蟲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"————————！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"熔岩蟲被激怒了......！我去擋住它們，攻擊就交給你們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"大尾巴！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"總算能從岩漿的縫隙裡瞄準弱點了呐，但是對方這個尺寸，我可不能保證有效喔！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨大源石蟲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——————！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"成功了！它被趕回之前的方向了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！這樣一來，市民們就都徹底安全了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"真是的！沒想到解決一隻蟲子會這麼費勁！這下我的裙子也毀了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟它帶領著一整支族群。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是有人先破壞了它們的生存環境，也許......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"我累了！不要再提起這種讓人疲憊的話題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我也已經，累得快站不起來了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我們得回到汐斯塔，還有人在等我們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是能理解你的想法啦，不過站不穩的時候找同伴搭把手，也是成熟的女性應該學會的事情喔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"謝、謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，凱旋而歸總是令人心情愉悅。趕緊回去吧，說不定還能剩下點度假時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"......但是......這裡還是遲早會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"大尾巴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我這就來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"......天火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們應該尊重這座城市的選擇，剩下的不該由我們插手，不是嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_145_prove","aliases":["普羅旺斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_166_skfire","aliases":["天火"]},{"speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","aliases":["錫蘭"]}]}
